    &lt;li&gt;&lt;xref href="#"&gt;Next&lt;/xref&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;</codeblock>
        </section>
      </tabbed-dialog>
    <section>
      <title>Sizing</title>
      <p>Fancy larger or smaller pagination? Use <xmlatt>size="large"</xmlatt> or
          <xmlatt>size="small"</xmlatt> for additional sizes.</p>
